<title>POLAND: Polish average wage edges up to PLN 1,025 in Feb.</title>
<headline>Polish average wage edges up to PLN 1,025 in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish average wages in the enterprise sector rose slightly to 1,025 zlotys in February, from 1,024 zlotys in January, and was 21.9 percent higher than a year ago, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p> POLISH AVERAGE WAGES	FEBRUARY   JANUARY     FEB 1995</p>
<p> average mthly wage PLN     1,025	1,024	  841</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
